  "goodToKnow": "Die Beratungsstelle is an advice centre or counselling service. Germany has many, mostly free, run by charities like Caritas and Diakonie or by authorities: Schuldnerberatung (debt), Suchtberatung (addiction), Erziehungsberatung (parenting), Migrationsberatung, and Schwangerschaftskonfliktberatung, required before an abortion. Die Beratung means advice or consultation. Plural: die Beratungsstellen."
